# Architecture

- Renderer calls **only** preload `window.mmcf.*` — no MCP, Node, or SQLite.
- State: Zustand. Business logic and Cloudflare calls stay in main services.

# Design system (§10)

- Tailwind 4 with semantic CSS variables (`--background`, `--primary`, `--danger`, etc.) — avoid scattered hard-coded colors.
- Theme: `system` (default) | `light` | `dark` via `<html data-theme="...">`; follow OS when system; no flash on startup.
- Font size: exact labels **SM | S | MD | L** via `<html data-font-size="...">` and root typography tokens.
- Reusable `Button` variants: primary, secondary, ghost, destructive; adaptive disabled/loading states.
- Opened zone vs bulk-selected row are **distinct** visual states (§6.3).

# Copy & UX

- All user-visible strings: **English**; prefer one centralized strings module.
- Destructive/high-impact actions: confirmation dialogs (§10.8). Dirty forms: protect navigation (§11.4).
- While tasks run: disable conflicting actions; show progress; do not leave buttons stuck after timeout (§9).
